# The value of an intended answer (answers/intended,
# hard_answers/hard_intended, infinite_members/infinite_point,
# api_capture_traps/capture_trap, leading_zero_traps/leading_zero_point): a
# Scott sum of four constructors, in order: boolean, whose one field is a
# Church Boolean of corpora/library/prelude/boolean; natural, whose one field
# is the count; certificate, whose one field is the certificate's name; and
# none. Read by its position (com.yang_bo.gezi.contest.corpora.claims.IntendedValue).
λ export
. export
  (λvalue boolean natural certificate none. boolean value)
  (λcount boolean natural certificate none. natural count)
  (λname boolean natural certificate none. certificate name) λboolean natural certificate none. none
